      "source": "self",
      "text": "On Day 31: from about 06:45 to 08:15 I was at home; around 08:19 I passed through Mill Road; around 08:25 I passed through the square; from about 08:30 to 12:00 I was at the grocery; around 12:04 I passed through the square; from about 12:00 to 13:15 I was at the Lantern; around 13:11 I passed through the square; from about 13:15 to 18:00 I was at the grocery.",
