      "place": null,
      "source": "self",
      "text": "On Day 31: from about 06:45 to 07:15 I was at home; around 07:12 I passed through Mill Road; from about 07:15 to 16:15 I was at the mill; around 16:16 I passed through Mill Road; around 16:22 I passed through the square; from about 16:30 to 17:00 I was at the grocery; around 17:03 I passed through the square; around 17:05 I passed through Mill Road; from about 17:00 to 18:00 I was at home.",
