      "text": "On Day 31: from about 06:45 to 08:15 I was at home; around 08:08 I passed through Mill Road; around 08:14 I passed through the square; from about 08:15 to 17:00 I was at the workshop; around 17:04 I passed through the square; around 17:10 I passed through Mill Road; from about 17:15 to 18:00 I was at home.",
