      "source": "self",
      "text": "On Day 31: from about 06:45 to 10:15 I was at home; around 10:18 I passed through the square; from about 10:15 to 11:00 I was at the grocery; around 11:02 I passed through the square; from about 11:00 to 17:15 I was at home, asleep for most of it; around 17:17 I passed through the square; from about 17:15 to 18:00 I was at the Lantern.",
