      "text": "On Day 31: from about 06:45 to 08:00 I was at home; around 08:07 I passed through the square; from about 08:15 to 09:00 I was at the grocery; around 09:02 I passed through the square; from about 09:00 to 17:15 I was at the clinic; around 17:14 I passed through the square; from about 17:15 to 18:00 I was at home.",
