      "place": null,
      "source": "self",
      "text": "On Day 31: from about 06:45 to 10:15 I was at home; around 10:09 I passed through the square; from about 10:15 to 11:15 I was at the grocery; around 11:13 I passed through the square; from about 11:15 to 18:00 I was at the Lantern.",
